{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 13709170452418624458,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Calculating the determinant using Kraut method",
      "source_hash": 2151486119703294796,
      "context_hash": 10005200040980529027,
      "translation": "Kraut 방법을 이용한 행렬식 계산",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:35:53.006329Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Calculating the determinant using Kraut method in $O(N^3)$",
      "source_hash": 10101416351263110770,
      "context_hash": 17585745503121481050,
      "translation": "$O(N^3)$에 Kraut 방법을 이용하여 행렬식을 계산하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:35:53.006330Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "In this article, we'll describe how to find the determinant of the matrix using Kraut method, which works in $O(N^3)$.",
      "source_hash": 13417585051126447074,
      "context_hash": 16925972256652191074,
      "translation": "이 글에서는 $O(N^3)$에 동작하는 Kraut 방법을 이용하여 행렬의 행렬식을 구하는 방법을 설명합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:35:53.006330Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The Kraut algorithm finds decomposition of matrix $A$ as $A = L U$ where $L$ is lower triangular and $U$ is upper triangular matrix.",
      "source_hash": 13368824128573796989,
      "context_hash": 11111665911179639188,
      "translation": "Kraut 알고리즘은 행렬 $A$를 $A = L U$로 분해하는데, 여기서 $L$은 하삼각행렬이고 $U$는 상삼각행렬입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:35:53.006330Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Without loss of generality, we can assume that all the diagonal elements of $L$ are equal to 1.",
      "source_hash": 12014791872145861545,
      "context_hash": 15857422098266573409,
      "translation": "일반성을 잃지 않고, $L$의 모든 대각 원소가 1과 같다고 가정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:35:53.006330Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "Once we know these matrices, it is easy to calculate the determinant of $A$: it is equal to the product of all the elements on the main diagonal of the matrix $U$.",
      "source_hash": 8937123199823032575,
      "context_hash": 10028788092901717134,
      "translation": "이 행렬들을 알고 나면 $A$의 행렬식을 계산하는 것은 쉬운데, 이는 행렬 $U$의 주대각선 위 모든 원소의 곱과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:35:53.006330Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "There is a theorem stating that any invertible matrix has a LU-decomposition, and it is unique, if and only if all its principle minors are non-zero.",
      "source_hash": 17826151700153746676,
      "context_hash": 13801110038947631293,
      "translation": "가역인 임의의 행렬은 모든 주소행렬식이 0이 아닐 때, 그리고 오직 그때에만 LU 분해를 가지며 그 분해가 유일하다는 정리가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:35:53.006331Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "We consider only such decomposition in which the diagonal of matrix $L$ consists of ones.",
      "source_hash": 13593793331163593787,
      "context_hash": 12280598498531907599,
      "translation": "우리는 행렬 $L$의 대각선이 모두 1로 이루어진 분해만을 고려합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:35:53.006331Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Let $A$ be the matrix and $N$ - its size.",
      "source_hash": 3708298000632846927,
      "context_hash": 10371957766589981614,
      "translation": "$A$를 행렬이라 하고 $N$을 그 크기라고 합시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:35:53.006331Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "We will find the elements of the matrices $L$ and $U$ using the following steps:",
      "source_hash": 7824376987369089080,
      "context_hash": 12899536664206717861,
      "translation": "다음 단계들을 이용하여 행렬 $L$과 $U$의 원소들을 구할 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:35:53.006331Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Let $L_{i i} = 1$ for $i = 1, 2, ..., N$.",
      "source_hash": 8951790330296584433,
      "context_hash": 10512766819530000564,
      "translation": "$i = 1, 2, ..., N$에 대해 $L_{i i} = 1$이라 합시다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:35:53.006331Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "For each $j = 1, 2, ..., N$ perform:",
      "source_hash": 882224250606005481,
      "context_hash": 12676467193232715141,
      "translation": "각 $j = 1, 2, ..., N$에 대해 다음을 수행합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:35:53.006332Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "For $i = 1, 2, ..., j$ find values",
      "source_hash": 4723147275519158279,
      "context_hash": 11353510201757147561,
      "translation": "$i = 1, 2, ..., j$에 대해 값을 구합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:35:53.006332Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Next, for $i = j+1, j+2, ..., N$ find values",
      "source_hash": 14524303176042008948,
      "context_hash": 5736561067949578095,
      "translation": "다음으로, $i = j+1, j+2, ..., N$에 대해 값을 구합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:35:53.006332Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 12237343584668575715,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-19T19:35:53.006332Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}